    "3 dashes hot sauce, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook Brussels sprouts in boiling water, stirring occasionally, until tender, about 15 minutes. Drain and transfer to a large bowl.",
